113
00:09:15,622 --> 00:09:19,959
Well, it seems like the poison is not life-threatening, so I'm glad.

114
00:09:19,959 --> 00:09:24,297
On the contrary, it's scary that they're using poisons that don't kill people.

115
00:09:24,297 --> 00:09:27,967
